====Usage notes====
* The dative form ''hönd'' is used in the sense of “handwriting”.
* The plural form ''höndur'' is mostly obsolete.
* The alternative form {{term|hendi|lang=is}} is sometimes used for nominative and accusative singular in [[non-standard]] [[colloquial]] speech; especially regarding sports.

